    "label": "64",
    "prompt": "Simplify the following.\n$$\\sqrt{25x^3y}$$",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$5|x|\\sqrt{xy}$, for $xy\\ge0$.\n\nExtract the square factor using $\\sqrt{x^2}=|x|$.",
      "worked": "The original expression is real exactly when $xy\\ge0$.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sqrt{25x^3y}&=\\sqrt{25x^2(xy)}\\\\\\sqrt{25x^3y}&=5\\sqrt{x^2}\\sqrt{xy}\\\\\\sqrt{25x^3y}&=5|x|\\sqrt{xy}.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
